  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food assistance to conflict-affected returnee populations in Mocimboa da Praia district of Cabo Delgado province in northern Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide lifesaving food assistance to conflict-affected returnees in Mocimboa da Praia district. This WFP project provides in-kind and voucher-based food assistance to vulnerable returnee families. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 26,991 people, including 6,745 men, 7,020 women, 13,226 children, and 432 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
